# Story assignment lock

`assign_story_thread` uses `pg_advisory_xact_lock` (**SCALING HOTSPOT**). It prevents concurrent upserts from missing soft pairs. Do not delete it as a “cleanup” without an alternate race fix (reconcile job / seeker Lambda) and an explicit product decision.
